    "section": "TEST: Chocolate Mug Cake",
    "text": "Category: Dessert\r\nCuisine: Western\r\nTags: chocolate, dessert, microwave\n\nIngredients:\r\n- 4 tbsp flour\r\n- 2 tbsp cocoa powder\r\n- 2 tbsp sugar\r\n- 3 tbsp milk\r\n- 2 tbsp vegetable oil\r\n- 1 pinch salt\r\n- 1 pinch baking powder\n\nSteps:\r\n1. Mix all ingredients in a mug.\r\n2. Stir until smooth.\r\n3. Microwave for 1 minute 30 seconds.\r\n4. Let cool slightly before eating.\n\nNotes:\r\nTop with ice cream for a richer dessert."
